{"pageid":4034,"title":"Icelands","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Icelands</span>","revid":20514,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Icelands</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/82/Icelands.webp/revision/latest?cb=20250428054008\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Icelands\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/82/Icelands.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250428054008\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/82/Icelands.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250428054008 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/82/Icelands.webp/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250428054008 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Icelands\" width=\"270\" height=\"139\" data-image-key=\"Icelands.webp\" data-image-name=\"Icelands.webp\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Icelands</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.71.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 1st, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Icelands</b> is a new snowy biome that was introduced in <a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.71.0\" title=\"Version 1.71.0\">v1.71.0</a>. This biome contains <a href=\"/wiki/Snow_tree\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snow tree\">Snow Trees</a><b>,</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Icestone\" title=\"Icestone\">Icestone</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Blizzard_Bloom\" title=\"Blizzard Bloom\">Blizzard bloom</a>. The Icelands are semi-connected to the snowy peaks via the cable car or the icy sea. This is a place of interest because in this place there are many things and quests inside it which are, <a href=\"/wiki/Gizmo%27s_Observatory\" title=\"Gizmo&#39;s Observatory\">Gizmo's Observatory</a>, celestial shop, getting Auroracrest items, etc. Once you have reached the Icelands, many caves require either a <b><a href=\"/wiki/Flamethrower\" title=\"Flamethrower\">flamethrower</a></b> or <b><a href=\"/wiki/Dynamite_Stick\" title=\"Dynamite Stick\">explo</a><a href=\"/wiki/Large_Bomb\" title=\"Large Bomb\">sive</a></b> to be accessed and there are many icy platforms with holes in them. After the Christmas 2024 update, it is now located in the far west of the map, west of where <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a> used to be. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <b>Icelands</b> are one of the only places <a href=\"/wiki/Boreal\" title=\"Boreal\">Boreal</a> trees and <a href=\"/wiki/Aurore\" title=\"Aurore\">Aurore</a> rock can spawn</li>\n<li>On one of the stone pillars near Station B, you can find ice with a strange glow inside and thick smoke. If you approach it closely, you will hear strange sounds and screams. You can melt the ice, but nothing will happen. It is currently unknown why this object was created.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903040221\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 52/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 63/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019399/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.026      1 Template:Buildings\n100.00%   28.026      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4034-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903040221 and revision id 20514. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Locations"],"links":[{"title":"Acidlands","exists":true},{"title":"Aurore","exists":true},{"title":"Blizzard Bloom","exists":true},{"title":"Boreal","exists":true},{"title":"Dynamite Stick","exists":true},{"title":"Flamethrower","exists":true},{"title":"Gizmo's Observatory","exists":true},{"title":"Icestone","exists":true},{"title":"Large Bomb","exists":true